Student submissions land here, one folder per student:

  src/submissions/<lastname-firstname>/<sandbox-or-assignment-slug>/

/api/submit writes them; src/lib/submissions.js reads them. The folder is kept
in git while it is empty so that scripts/sync-assets.js still has a source to
mirror (and therefore to prune static/submissions from).

There are deliberately no example submissions. Do not add one.
